        "title": "Establishes \"Cindi's Law\" requiring certain diagnostic tests for uterine cancer",
        "briefDescription": "This act establishes \"Cindi's Law\", requiring all tests of abnormal cytological or histological endometrial samples from the uterine lining to include a test to detect the presence and pattern of abnormalities in the p53 protein for the purposes of diagnosis and treatment of uterine cancer.",
