        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Enacts provisions relating to the Department of Transportation's fiber network",
        "briefDescription": "This act creates the \"Department of Transportation Fiber Network Expansion Act\", which provides that the Missouri Highways and Transportation Commission may enter into public-private partnerships with private broadband internet service providers to expand and develop the Department of Transportation's fiber network. The Commission shall prioritize expansion and development under the act in unserved areas and underserved areas, as defined by law.",
        "lrNumber": "3816S.01I",
