        "title": "Establishes the \"Missouri Lyme Disease Eradication Act\"",
        "briefDescription": "This act establishes the \"Missouri Lyme Disease Eradication Act\".  First, Lyme disease is added to the list of diseases that must be reported to the Department of Health and Senior Services by health care providers, laboratories, and local health departments.  The Department shall compile an annual report on the incidence and prevalence of Lyme disease in Missouri, as described in the act.  The Department shall also collaborate with public four-year institutions of higher education to integrate ",
        "lrNumber": "5289S.01I",
