        "title": "Requires the State Board of Education to cause its annual report to be published on the website of the Department of Elementary and Secondary Education",
        "briefDescription": "This act requires the State Board of Education to cause its annual report to be published on the website of the Department of Elementary and Secondary Education (DESE), in addition to printing 60 copies for DESE and the State Library.",
