        "title": "Renames the \"Missouri Student Religious Liberties Act\" the \"Missouri Safeguarding Personal Expression at K-12 Schools (SPEAKS) Act\" and creates provisions safeguarding students' political and ideological expression at public schools",
        "briefDescription": "This act renames the \"Missouri Student Religious Liberties Act\" the \"Missouri Safeguarding Personal Expression at K-12 Schools (SPEAKS) Act\".  The act adds political and ideological expression to the current protections for public school students' religious expression.",
        "lrNumber": "4431S.02I",
