        "billSuffix": 923,
        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Repeals provisions authorizing the establishment of charter schools in Boone County",
        "briefDescription": "This act repeals provisions authorizing the establishment of charter schools in Boone County.",
