        "title": "Creates provisions relating to foreign ownership of real estate near military installations",
        "briefDescription": "Under the act, after the effective date of the act, an alien, foreign business, or foreign government shall not acquire any real estate, including agricultural land, in the state for any purpose within 50 miles from any military installation or commercial establishment engaged in the development and manufacture of classified military or naval equipment.",
