        "title": "Modifies the Historic Preservation Tax Credit",
        "briefDescription": "This act modifies the definition of \"applicable percentage\" for the purpose of determining the value of a historic preservation tax credit by providing that the applicable percentage for the rehabilitation of a property that is a historic school shall be 35%.",
        "lrNumber": "4795S.01I",
