        "billSuffix": 1007,
        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Modifies provisions relating to child passenger restraint systems",
        "briefDescription": "This act provides that children under two years old shall be secured in a rear-facing child passenger restraint system when transported in a motor vehicle.",
