        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Enacts provisions relating to insurance coverage for cancer treatment",
        "briefDescription": "This act enacts \"The Missouri Advanced Stage Cancer Cost Burden Cap\".  The act provides that no health benefit plan shall impose cost-sharing for treatment of advanced stage cancer, as defined in the act, other than the deductible otherwise applicable under the plan.",
        "lrNumber": "3817S.01I",
