        "billPrefix": "SB",
        "billSuffix": 1062,
        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Establishes the \"Hope Missouri\" Act",
        "briefDescription": "This act creates the \"Hope Missouri\" Act. The act establishes the Hope Missouri Office within the Office of Administration, with the Commissioner of Administration acting as the director of the office. The Office is charged with the following responsibilities:",
        "lrNumber": "5396S.01I",
