        "title": "Limits the sale or purchase of certain drugs",
        "briefDescription": "Currently, no person shall sell, dispense, or purchase, over a 12 month period, more than a total amount of 43.2 grams of certain meth precursors.  This act increases the amount to 61.2 grams.",
