        "title": "Creates the \"Missouri Higher Education Funding Policy Prioritization Act\" and creates and modifies provisions relating to higher education workforce policy prioritization",
        "briefDescription": "This act creates the \"Missouri Higher Education Funding Policy Prioritization Act\" and creates and modifies provisions relating to higher education workforce policy prioritization.",
