        "billSuffix": 1157,
        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Establishes provisions relating to the issuance of professional and occupational licenses to certain individuals with federal employment authorizations",
        "briefDescription": "This act provides that a person has demonstrated lawful presence for eligibility of a professional or occupational license if the person submits certain documents relating to employment authorization issued by certain federal agencies, as described in the act. A professional or occupational license issued to a person demonstrating lawful presence under this act shall be valid only for the period of time during which the employment authorization is valid.",
        "lrNumber": "3905S.01I",
