        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Creates provisions relating to an extreme risk order of protection",
        "briefDescription": "This act creates the \"Firearm Violence Prevention Act\", which establishes an extreme risk protection order to prevent a person who is found to pose an extreme risk to him or herself or others from possessing, controlling, or owning a firearm.",
