        "billSuffix": 1275,
        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Permits over-the-counter purchase of ivermectin and hydroxycholorquine tablets without a prescription",
        "briefDescription": "Under this act, ivermectin tablets and hydroxychloroquine tablets shall be available through over-the-counter purchases in Missouri without a prescription or consultation with a health care provider.",
