        "billSuffix": 1280,
        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Creates and modifies provisions relating to access to pornographic materials",
        "briefDescription": "Currently, public schools and public libraries are required to take certain actions to prevent minors from accessing pornographic materials on a public access computer.  This act adds charter schools, digital library catalogs, and explicit sexual material to these provisions of law.",
        "lrNumber": "4700S.01I",
