        "billSuffix": 1281,
        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Repeals the sunset for the program providing grants for certain cyber crime investigations",
        "briefDescription": "This act repeals the sunset date of the Cyber Crime Investigation Fund and the grant program created under the Fund.",
