        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Creates provisions relating to telephone solicitations to businesses",
        "briefDescription": "This act extends provisions relating to telemarketing practices to business subscribers, as defined in the act. The Attorney General shall develop literature to help consumers understand their options with regard to telephone solicitations no later than January 1, 2027, instead of January 1, 2001 as provided in current law.",
