        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Modifies provisions relating to the State Tax Commission's ratio studies",
        "briefDescription": "This act provides that, in any ratio study in which the State Tax Commission evaluates the assessment ratios of the various counties, the Commission shall require that no county's ratio of assessed values is greater than one.",
        "lrNumber": "5190S.02I",
