        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Prohibits giving preferential treatment or discrimination based upon ESG scores",
        "briefDescription": "This act creates new provisions relating to public contracts. This act is identical to SB 338 (2025) and SB 1142 (2024).",
