        "billPrefix": "SB",
        "billSuffix": 1411,
        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Creates provisions relating to a competitive retail electricity market",
        "briefDescription": "The act creates \"The Electrical Choice and Competition Law.\" Provisions of the act shall govern the sale of electricity in the state and any provision of law that conflicts with the act shall be null and void.",
