        "title": "Increases the maximum gross income for eligibility for the Fast Track Workforce Incentive Grant",
        "briefDescription": "This act increases the maximum gross income for eligibility for the Fast Track Workforce Incentive Grant from $80,000 to $100,000 for taxpayers who are married filing jointly and from $40,000 to $50,000 for all other taxpayers, adjusted annually based on inflation.",
        "lrNumber": "6231S.01I",
