        "title": "Modifies provisions relating to telemedicine",
        "briefDescription": "Currently, the establishment of a physician-patient relationship for purposes of telehealth shall include an interview and a physical examination.  Under this act, an evaluation is required, but a physical examination shall be required only if needed to meet the standard of care.",
