        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Creates the Civil Liberties Defense Act, which provides that certain rulings shall be unenforceable if based on certain foreign laws",
        "briefDescription": "This act creates the Civil Liberties Defense Act, which mandates that any court, arbitration, tribunal, or administrative agency ruling shall be unenforceable if based on a foreign law which is repugnant or inconsistent with the Constitutions of Missouri and of the United States.",
