        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Modifies provisions relating to motor vehicle inspections",
        "briefDescription": "This act provides that vehicle identification number and odometer inspections for titling purposes may be performed by an employee of a licensed new or used motor vehicle dealer if the vehicle is sold to a person who lives out of state and intends to register the vehicle out of state, or if the motor vehicle has less than 30,000 miles for the three-year period following the model year of manufacture.",
        "lrNumber": "6208S.01I",
