        "title": "Authorizes Bollinger County to impose a sales tax for county purposes",
        "briefDescription": "This act authorizes Bollinger County to impose a sales tax at a rate not to exceed 1% for the purpose of providing funding for county facilities including, but not limited to, the operation and maintenance of county facilities.",
