        "title": "Establishes the Missouri Consent and Likeness Protection Act, which provides requirements for contracts for the use of an individual's identifiable attributes",
        "briefDescription": "This act establishes the \"Missouri Consent and Likeness Protection Act\" which provides that no adhesion contract, disclaimer or waiver, or condition of entry shall be valid or enforceable if it:",
