        "billSuffix": 1514,
        "session": "261",
        "chamber": "senate",
        "title": "Repeals The Missouri Economic Diversification and Afforestation Act of 1990",
        "briefDescription": "The act repeals the \"The Missouri Economic Diversification and Afforestation Act of 1990\".",
