        "briefDescription": "This act establishes the Interstate Dental and Dental Hygienist Licensure Compact (\"Compact\"), which facilitates the interstate practice of dentistry and dental hygiene and provides for dentists and dental hygienists licensed in a participating state to have expedited licensure portability in other participating states.",
