        "title": "Creates provisions relating to reimbursement by electric utilities to customers for losses incurred from electric service interruption",
        "briefDescription": "Under the act, an electrical corporation shall reimburse a customer for any loss resulting from an electric service interruption lasting for more than 48 hours.",
