        "title": "Modifies provisions relating to deferred compensation for state employees",
        "briefDescription": "This act provides that the election to defer compensation by the employees of the state of Missouri shall be made at the beginning of the payroll period, rather than the month, for which the compensation is paid and contributions shall begin on the pay period beginning after such election.",
