        "title": "Modifies provisions relating to firearm accessories",
        "briefDescription": "This act prohibits the possession or manufacturing of rapid fire devices for firearms, which shall include any accessory attached to a semiautomatic firearm that increases the rate of fire of that firearm.  Such violation shall be a class D felony.",
